{"server":"cn","storyId":"act10d5_level_act10d5_st02","groupId":"act10d5","stageId":null,"title":"被选择的","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act10d5/level_act10d5_st02.txt","sourceHash":"51c5a9f317fb13b3e15d122073a01425c0b65a1ce776a2352f2ff573ba6de760","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"真理 被选择的"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"电源，接上了，没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"在录了吗？啊——啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好像没问题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"该说点什么好呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我使用的这台器械，是可露希尔小姐租借给我的，用途是......嗯，申请书上写的用途是“真实情境暴露式创伤记录自我诊疗”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......好长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，机械的操作很方便，只要确认电量充足，然后打开开关......像这样，就会自动开始录像了。嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（好难，自说自话好难。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（只是自己对着屏幕说话，本来还以为会比较简单呢......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"在我提出想要尝试去缓和与克制自己的症状时，医疗部的干员向我提出了这样的建议——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"“要不要试试看自我倾诉”......这样的建议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，虽然现在是开着录像，但这些并不是会给别人看的东西。不如说，我绝不想给任何人看到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"放轻松，真理，放轻松。嗯嗯，只是随便说点什么，不要紧张，给自己听，想说什么都行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些现在还没有办法说给别人听的事，可以一遍一遍说给自己听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得，这是一个可行的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"关于之前的一些事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"就算现在大家看起来都还没什么问题，但是我知道，我们有很多东西要解决，只是迟早的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，古米也好早露也好，都没能忘记之前的那些事，在学校里发生的那些，彻底离开学校之后发生的那些，不会有人忘得掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"凛冬她......凛冬她最近好像总是在做噩梦，烈夏看起来很放得下，但是真的......可以放得下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我呢？我又是怎么样呢，我认为我可以面对，但是，我真的......可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都闭口不谈，可是，不论如何，最后总归还是要面对。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......真难啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......好吧，我觉得我好像逐渐有一点习惯这样自言自语了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"正式开始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，或许应该从自我介绍开始？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫做“真理”——当然，这只是个代号，本名是安娜·莫罗佐娃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯，总觉得有很久没有提过这个名字了，明明是自己的名字，却有点陌生，真奇怪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"这位是薇卡，是我的好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"薇卡她，是我在加入学生自治团前，最好的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我居住于罗德岛这个组织的本营内，隶属于“乌萨斯学生自治团”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，学生自治团，虽然是我的提议，但真正组建它的人是凛冬。以及，虽说是一个独立的团体，目前成员也不过只有五个人而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"凛冬，娜塔莉娅，烈夏，古米，还有我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"之前其实还有更多的成员，不过现在只剩下我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，当然，薇卡她也是我们之中的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"目前我们都作为罗德岛的“干员”......应该算是在工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得这样不坏。劳有所得，这很公平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"凛冬暂时不打算离开这里，虽然她不说，但我知道她也不讨厌这样。有时我也会想，或许我们就这样一直走下去也不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，虽然现在大家聚在一起，但我们五个人并不是同一所学校的学生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我和古米，还有娜塔莉娅，是同一所高中的学生，而凛冬还有烈夏属于另一所学校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，虽然不是同校，但是凛冬从过去起就一直很出名，市内相邻的几所学校，没有学生不认识她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......我认为她是那种天生就适合成为领袖的类型。实际上，她也的确理所应当一样做着我们的领头人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"在我们都毫无防备的时候，整合运动进攻、并占领了我们的城市切尔诺伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"发生了一些......事情，整合运动占领城区时，我所在的学校中的一部分学生，被强行押送到了凛冬她们所在的校园。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"或许还有其他学校的学生也被聚集到了一起，我不清楚，那时候所有的一切都很混乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不清楚他们这样做的用意，为首的那个整合运动头目，是个白头发的少年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来没有多大年纪，他是不是还没有我们大？我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"他似乎用一套什么理由说服了在场的其他头目，将许多学生带走，我们都被关在了凛冬他们的学校内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"现在回想起来，真是太荒唐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后，是长达十数天的封锁，以及......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_5"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_school"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_schoolyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼，太好了，幸好来的人是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉我一把，安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......安娜？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......以及争斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"被封锁在校园内的争斗，还有彻底脱离校园后，在整个切尔诺伯格城区中的争斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我们每个人，都有一些不得不去面对的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（这个时间，应该不是古米，那会是谁......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"请稍等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（这个录像，关闭之前的保存操作有点麻烦，就这么放着应该也没问题吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"请问是哪位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我啦是我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊？预备探员真理小姐！你是不是在装傻，我的声音你怎么可能听不出来啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯，好吵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，之前也说过了，我并不是什么预备探员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，你们的关系真好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，安娜，我也一起来叨扰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉娅？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"给，红茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，谢谢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......好香啊，哼哼，看来是很不错的茶叶嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，刚刚那么久没开门，真理你是在忙吗？我是不是打扰到你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"如果很忙的话，我之后再来也行，反正也只是来还书给你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是什么特别要紧的事情，不要在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，根据我的了解，既然安娜本人这么说，那就不用介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"安娜是不会在这种事情上说谎的。对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，那就好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不过，没想到你居然还有锁门的习惯，还真谨慎啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"不错不错，看来你已经具备身为一个预备探员应有的谨慎了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"停一下，我可不是什么预备探员，请你不要瞎说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，门只是刚才碰巧有点事情才锁上的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，安娜的确平常也会习惯性锁上门吧？毕竟你可是我们之中最谨慎的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉娅，你就不要打趣我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，抱歉抱歉，因为安娜的表情太可爱了，一不小心就。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀，不管怎么说，果然下午这个点还是该喝红茶，嗯嗯，真是太棒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你还真是喜欢红茶啊......现在你脸上的表情，就像是被烤化了的乳饼一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？欸？那是什么形容啊？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，就是很傻的意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什么啊，太过分了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼！算了，还不快快感谢心胸宽大的本侦探，看，我有给你带饼干来哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，饼干？唔嗯，稍微有点意外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"意外什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，没有想到你居然能想到要带点心来，我还以为你只会来蹭红茶呢。嗯，是我误会你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪是那种人啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"看仔细了，这可是我特别为你准备的谢礼！芙蓉特制蔬菜烤饼——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"好，请回吧，请你现在立刻回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，立刻，出门右转。不送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，不要这么抗拒，这次的蔬菜烤饼味道很清爽，非常不错哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"来，你尝尝看这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了......等等、住手，我自己会吃的，你别塞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔，唔唔唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，啊哈哈哈，安娜和梅小姐的关系真好，我都有点羡慕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理&梅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请不要乱说，谁和她关系好了！/嘿嘿，挺好的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也不算关系很差，还不错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"是我记错了，我和她关系一点都不好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理&梅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"？？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"娜、娜塔莉娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，噗嗤，哈哈哈，对、对不起，但是，但是你们明明就很有默契嘛，噗，阿哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"笑得太夸张了，真是的。算了......那，梅是来还书的，娜塔莉娅你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我吗，我最近有在考虑一些事情，所以想和真理讨论一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？是什么很重要的事情吗？......真难得，你居然会想到要来找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我可是一直都很想亲近安娜你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，也不是什么特别重要的事，我们之后再说也可以，现在就好好享受下午茶的时间吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，等一等，梅！小心一些，别端着红茶乱蹦乱跳，会洒出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我又不是小孩子了，才不会洒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，因为没想到会有人来，房间里稍微有点乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"宿舍里没有什么可以正经招待大家的地方，娜塔莉娅也别站着了，像梅一样随便找喜欢的地方坐就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就不客气啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不过的确，罗德岛提供的宿舍虽然该有的家具都会有，也很干净整洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但要是想要像以前招待朋友到家里来聚会那样，果然还是不行呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"请等一等，娜塔莉娅，我认为你说的那不是聚会，而是宴会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，宴会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"差很多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，有吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"绝对有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，开宴会啊，听起来就感觉很厉害的样子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，没有那么夸张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"都已经是过去的事情了。不管是大房子还是那样的生活，都已经和现在的我没有关系了，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼娅她也是，总拿这个取笑我，明明她心里也很清楚。这个人说话总是不好听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果没有安娜在的话，我看索尼娅她恐怕要和不少人都起冲突，唉，真没办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我其实觉得现在住的还是挺不错的，比起我之前奉命潜入调查的时候，可好了百倍不止呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，我说啊，真理你的房间明明已经很干净了吧！虽然书很多，但都非常整齐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因为平时姑且还有在收拾。而且，古米在卫生这方面一直很严格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这样说来，古米她的确是一直都很喜欢整理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是在当时那样的环境下，也还是会把收集回来的东西全都挨个收拾好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"现在也一样，完全没有改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"当时那样的环境......?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，有这样的室友，真不知道是该说幸福好，还是辛苦好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，摆在这里的这个娃娃是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，这个不可以碰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"干、干嘛，吓了我一跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"不用这么急着抢也可以吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"对、不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，这个，是对我来说很重要的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"这个是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"安娜，这是那个人的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你还带着这个娃娃，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"请别说了，娜塔莉娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"别说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，嗯，别担心，我没事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......安娜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"别说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"当初的那件事，我也有所耳闻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那是，那是没有办法的，没人能预想到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"别说了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然很遗憾，但我们大家都知道，那不是你的错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"别再说了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是迟了一步，你已经尽力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，谢谢你。不用担心，娜塔莉娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我没事的。\n一直以来，我总和所有人这样说。\n凛冬、古米、烈夏、娜塔莉娅......大家都相信我会没事。\n就连我自己，好像差点都要相信了。\n不是我的错。\n不是我的错吗？\n我只是来迟了。\n不，我没有来迟。\n我尽力了。\n......我尽力了。\n——我早已做出了选择。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这本小说！是不是我借的这个侦探系列的完结篇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，你说这一本。没有错，看来你的确很有眼光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"这是这个系列小说里最珍贵的一本，举世无双的大侦探的最后一幕......哼哼，是我拜托博士帮忙找了好久，才找到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......这样说起来，我之前回老家的时候，似乎在家里的书架上看到过附带作者签名的初版来着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"好怀念，最初读的时候我大哭了一场呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"签名，而且还是初版......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嗯，好像有点不妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得索尼娅她之前提起过，安娜为了弄到一本这位作者的签名版作品，费了不少功夫，但结果还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"也没有办法，毕竟是很难得的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟糕，莫非真的有这么珍贵？？老家这方面的东西太多，一时失察！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那个，真理！呃，对了，这本书，能借给我吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以是可以，但是，你不是之前看过了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"而且还是带有签名的初版（小声）。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"这个嘛......呃，虽然看过，但是都过去这么久了，我正好想要重温哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"居、居然在真理你这里能看到这本书，哈哈哈，真是太幸运了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你都这么说了，那......这次就借给你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"好耶！真理，你真是个好人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼......这样就没问题了吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"做得这么明显，要照顾别人的情绪，这还欠缺点火候呢。（小声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不过还是......谢谢。（小声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你刚刚说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这个蔬菜饼干真的蛮好吃的欸，真理你不吃吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我什么也没说，别在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不是什么奇怪的味道吗？好吧，让我也尝尝......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，梅你会和娜塔莉娅一起还真是少见，我怎么不记得你们认识？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......虽然不是很熟，不过，上次在秘密调查企鹅物流的时候，有被娜塔莉娅小姐帮助过一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里，很高兴能够帮上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"调查企鹅物流？啊，是你常提的，真意外，你居然还没放弃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不会放弃呢！赌上皇家侦探的名誉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我个人认为，皇家侦探的名誉应该早就被你赔光了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！哼，我才不和你计较！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，这次我们只是在来的路上偶然碰上而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"比起那个，你上次借我的那本小说也太好看了吧？刚刚看完，我现在就是很想赶快和人一起讨论！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，倒也不是不可以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我也好久没和别人聊过侦探小说了，之前借你的那本小说，里面有我很喜欢的诡计呢，怎么样，很精彩吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"简直太棒了！作者到底是怎么想出这种诡计的？呜啊我看到结局揭露真相的时候，简直汗毛都要竖起来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯，没错，将推理要素和文学创作结合起来，并且从现实心理上影响到读者，这一本是这个系列里我最喜欢的一本哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——我懂，我完全能够理解！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"以第一人称进行创作，凶手正是小说主——唔，唔唔唔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"笨蛋！怎么可以随便暴露真凶！娜塔莉娅她还没看过这本！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"噗——哈！差、差点憋死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔，好疼，我都咬到舌头了，不小心剧透的确是我不对，但真理你下手也太重了吧唔呃呃呃呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来很有趣，安娜真的很喜欢侦探小说，很少见你说话时这么兴奋哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，是、是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，嗯......这么有趣的话，下次也请让我也读读看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉娅你也有兴趣了？有点意外呢，明明之前我推荐给你的时候，你都只会说“下次有空一定”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，这个嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"看大家聊得这么开心，我也会想要加入话题嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好吧。不管怎么说，小说同好能增加，我是很欢迎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟在这里，能一起聊这方面作品的人实在太少了啦......博士倒是也会读，但是那个人太忙了，很难有机会抓到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......啊，是那位指挥官阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，果然娜塔莉娅小姐也知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，毕竟那一位在舰船上也比较特殊，而且，我也有拜见过那位指挥官进行战地指挥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，真是太遗憾了，今天他们好像也在开什么会议的样子，我本来还想把饼干也分博士一些的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"别操心了，芙蓉小姐一定会替博士留一份的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，博士的状态虽说有凯尔希医生在监控，但是可以看得出，大家都还是对此很关心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"特别是医疗组的干员们，最近我去测试的时候，还听几位医生在商量如何管控博士的饮食均衡，嗯......首先，先没收博士的零食？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，那些东西被没收也不奇怪吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......古米也和我抱怨过这个，真是的，那个人平常都在吃些什么呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，娜塔莉娅你说的测试，是指？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，关于这件事，请先容我保密，我还没有完全拿定主意......今天过来，其实也和这件事有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"今天还是算了，嗯，看起来，今天这个场合不太合适。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"或许，再过不久，安娜你就会知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，既然你这么说，那么我就不多问了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，言归正传，娜塔莉娅，就先从一些经典的作品开始读如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，居然又绕回到这个话题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，毕竟这可是向别人推荐自己喜欢的东西的大好机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不会让这个话题就这么轻易被带过的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......能感受到热情呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"那是当然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不要小看侦探小说，不论种类，优秀的作品中总是寄宿着灵魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，的确是很有安娜风格的发言。不过，嗯，你说的对，这一点我也很赞同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然去思考小说中的诡计，也是乐趣之一，不过我认为侦探小说的魅力绝不仅于此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"真理你说的的确没错啦，但是要我说的话，果然我最喜欢还是侦探揭穿犯人真面目的那一瞬间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"要说经典的话，果然还是“那个”吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"“那个”？你是指......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"就是“那个”！“那个”呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"“真相只有一个，凶手就是——你！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这个我也知道哦，是名侦探一定会说的台词之一呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，不管听多少次，都还是会让人热血沸腾的台词！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"的确是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在我看来，在找到犯人之后，才是真正有趣的，需要思考的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，梅，我问你，在找出犯人，抵达真相之后，侦探要怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"当着众人的面说出真相，以此来给对方定罪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"就算真相为人所知，但有时法律却已经拿罪人无可奈何，这种时候，又能怎么办呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"是就这么看着罪人逍遥法外，还是，自己作为审判者，采取行动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"这是在现实中也存在，很不好解决的问题呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是我的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"什么啊，你只是想问这个吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底在说什么傻话，真理，你今天怪怪的，是不是有哪里不舒服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"......奇怪了，也没发烧啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是找出真相的侦探，之后的事情当然是交给真正的警察去解决啊？侦探不是万能的，你可不要误会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"侦探、警察和法官，各自的职责都不同，这是常识吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"干嘛，你这是什么表情，有这么吃惊吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，侦探没有权力给别人定罪，这我当然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，从你的嘴里听到常识，还是挺让人意外的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"等下？喂喂，你什么意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，自言自语而已，请不要在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，虽然在现在的环境下，成天打打杀杀的人也不少，谋杀不谋杀什么的可能好多人早就已经不在意了，我这么说也有点微妙啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"但就算是这样，我们侦探所能做的，充其量也就是找出真相，维护法律而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有裁决的权利，更加无法凌驾法律之上，私刑什么的更是不行，不可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"恶事就是恶事，对他人的伤害，不管用怎样的理由来包裹，也都只是侵犯与伤害而已，行为的本质是不会变的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"的确，是这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是否为人知，不管会不会受裁决，做过的事情，至少自己绝对忘不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"侦探要做的，就是把这些埋藏的真相全部挖掘出来！唔，嗯嗯，你不觉得光是说出口，就非常帅气吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"做过的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不论是出于什么样的理由，不论是否暴露于世人眼中，已经发生过的事情是不会变的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"总有一天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，话题怎么好像变得沉重起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我不该提起这种讨论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不会哦，我在一边听也觉得是很有意义的讨论。不过，难得的下午茶时间，接下来还是来聊些轻松点的话题吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这是个好主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，茶都凉掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？咦，那个是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，梅？你从刚刚起，就靠在那边看什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那个啊，你们看，窗外那是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？窗外？有什么东西吗，我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......那边有什么东西在飞，啊，飞过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来，好像是一架无人机？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"无人机？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......还真的是无人机......为什么会在这种地方，等等，它好像挂在外檐上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，在舰船上应该不会有危险吧？既然没危险，就别想这么多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"笨蛋！干嘛跳上去......危险！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，拿到了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，梅小姐，小心脚下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_schoolyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼，太好了，幸好来的人是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那一天，她就那样滑落。\n身子微微扬起，风吹过长发，干净得同周围格格不入，干净得让我觉得，好像这段时间所发生的一切，都只是一场梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉我一把，安娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无法出声。无法言语。无法动弹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......安娜？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我轻轻触碰，这个美梦就这样滑落。\n无声无息，只在我的指尖留下些许痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，安娜，你要做什么？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我就这样看着她坠落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"梅小姐！太不小心了！要不要紧，有没有哪里摔伤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"疼疼疼，没关系没关系，别担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，这无人机上面挂了张纸条！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是给娜塔莉娅小姐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？给我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......让我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"梅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊，你怎么了，脸色好差！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？没有不舒服？别逞强哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"笨蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有人会跳上窗台还挂在屋檐上，就为了去拿一台不知道目的的无人机？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"一般来说，有常识的人会选择用工具，或者让我用法术也可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我没想那么多嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"请你下次多想一想再行动！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"别吓我啊。笨蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"把手伸出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？不用了吧......我真的没事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚，你左手在窗台上擦伤了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不要想着隐瞒，在我面前说谎是没有用的。你这个人真的很好懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"你眼怎么这么尖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是“预备探员”——这点观察力还是要有的，这不是你说的吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃呃呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，伤口不严重，这样擦干净，再喷上药......好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"之后记得找医疗干员再仔细处理一下，再小的伤口也不能大意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"都说了只是小伤而已，不用这么紧张！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"不过还是谢谢啦，嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（叹气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这个纸条，上面写的是赫默小姐的传讯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默医生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是我之前提到的，关于测试的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，赫默医生好厉害，怎么知道我在这里的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"用无人机的话，应该是有办法可以做到的吧？从凯尔希医生往下，医疗部的人都有一手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说也是呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啊，安娜，我得要去一趟医疗部才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，没关系，那边的事情比较重要，你先去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这样的话，今天我也先告辞啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"书也已经还了，还借到了接下来可以读的，嗯嗯，圆满成功！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"什么圆满成功啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"下次有机会，大家再一起聊天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一切顺利的话......嗯，或许很快就能够告诉自治团的大家一个好消息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我就期待着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"安娜，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉娅","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"下次见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅","speakerId":"char_133_mm","isRemote":false,"text":"下次见~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"好消息......吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"薇卡，你说，会是什么好消息呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉娅，还有凛冬，索尼娅她......如果她们能够好好相处的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你觉得一定可以？嗯，嗯，我也这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来没有忘记过，有关于你的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我忘记，你会怪我吗？你会怪我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你说不会？我知道这是在骗我。我知道的，薇卡，你在骗我，你根本不可能同我说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"一直和我在一起的你，至今依然在我身边的你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"总有一天，我们都要面对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是，不是现在，还不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，我还不够坚强，暂时我还是做不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_133_mm","aliases":["梅"]},{"speakerId":"char_195_glassb","aliases":["真理"]},{"speakerId":"char_197_poca","aliases":["娜塔莉娅"]}]}
